 class=\"__className_f367f3\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-slate-200 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-blue-200\">W</div><div><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight\">WeHear</p><p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-slate-400\">Vietnamese VSL</p></div></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex\"><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/\">Trang chủ</a><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/translate\">Dịch ký hiệu</a><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/dictionary\">Từ điển</a><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/lessons\">Bài học</a><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/community\">Cộng đồng</a><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/news\">Tin tức</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 sm:flex\"><a class=\"rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/login\">Đăng nhập</a><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-200 transition hover:bg-blue-700 active:scale-95\" href=\"/register\">Đăng ký</a></div><button class=\"rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-600 md:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"min-h-screen\"><div class=\"bg-[#f8fafc] min-h-screen pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center md:text-left bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 rounded-[32px] p-10 md:p-14 text-white shadow-xl shadow-blue-900/20 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4\">Cộng đồng <span class=\"text-blue-200\">Wehear</span></h1><p class=\"text-blue-100 font-medium text-lg max-w-2xl\">Nơi kết nối, học hỏi và chia sẻ kiến thức về ngôn ngữ ký hiệu. Cùng nhau xây dựng một cộng đồng không rào cản.</p></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-20 -mr-20 w-80 h-80 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-40 -mb-20 w-60 h-60 bg-blue-400/20 rounded-full blur-2xl\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-8\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><button class=\"w-full bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-4 flex items-center gap-4 hover:border-blue-200 transition-all text-slate-400 group shadow-sm\"><div class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-camera\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.997 4a2 2 0 0 1 1.76 1.05l.486.9A2 2 0 0 0 18.003 7H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1.997a2 2 0 0 0 1.759-1.048l.489-.904A2 2 0 0 1 10.004 4z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"font-medium\">Bạn có câu hỏi hay chia sẻ gì không?</span></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 gap-4 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-loader-circle animate-spin text-blue-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-6.219-8.56\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs\">Đang tải thảo luận...</p></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block lg:col-span-4 space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-900 text-lg mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-blue-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Về cộng đồng</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Wehear là không gian an toàn và tôn trọng. Mọi đóng góp đều có giá trị trong việc lan tỏa ngôn ngữ ký hiệu Việt Nam.</p><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center py-4 border-y border-slate-50\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"font-black text-xl text-slate-800\">1.2K</div><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Thành viên</div></div><div class=\"w-px h-8 bg-slate-100\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"font-black text-xl text-slate-800\">340</div><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Bài viết</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-900 text-lg mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg> Chủ đề nổi bật</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-slate-300 font-black text-lg group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors\">0<!-- -->1</span><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors\">Hỏi đáp từ vựng</span></div><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg\">50<!-- --> bài</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-slate-300 font-black text-lg group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors\">0<!-- -->2</span><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors\">Kỹ năng giao tiếp</span></div><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg\">40<!-- --> bài</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-slate-300 font-black text-lg group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors\">0<!-- -->3</span><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors\">Góc chia sẻ</span></div><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg\">30<!-- --> bài</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-slate-300 font-black text-lg group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors\">0<!-- -->4</span><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors\">Sự kiện Offline</span></div><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 bg-slate-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg\">20<!-- --> bài</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 p-6 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-900 text-lg mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star text-yellow-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg> Đóng góp tích cực</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black bg-blue-100 text-blue-600\">T</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-sm text-slate-800\">Nguyễn Trọng Tường</div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500\">Chuyên gia</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black bg-pink-100 text-pink-600\">M</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-sm text-slate-800\">Trần Thị Mai</div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500\">Thành viên tích cực</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600\">H</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-sm text-slate-800\">Lê Hoàng</div><div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500\">Học viên</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-6 py-12 md:grid-cols-3\"><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">WeHear</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Nền tảng hỗ trợ nhận diện và dịch ngôn ngữ ký hiệu tiếng Việt sang văn bản, giúp tăng khả năng giao tiếp và tiếp cận thông tin cho cộng đồng người khiếm thính.</p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Điều hướng</h4><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/\">Trang chủ</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/translate\">Dịch ký hiệu</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/dictionary\">Từ điển</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-600\" href=\"/news\">Tin tức</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-900\">Thông tin dự án</h4><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600\"><li>Khóa luận tốt nghiệp</li><li>AI + Web Application</li><li>Ngôn ngữ ký hiệu tiếng Việt</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 px-6 py-4 text-center text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 WeHear. All rights reserved.</div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-67c603305a6eb0fa.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[15244,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[43866,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[4219,[\\\"7807\\\",\\\"static/chunks/7807-2c8d2f7857c1b84a.js\\\",\\\"2340\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2340-0580248f22a188c2.js\\\",\\\"8173\\\",\\\"static/chunks/8173-ffc9198dd913f23b.js\\\",\\\"5565\\\",\\\"static/chunks/5565-e0050840a0617314.js\\\",\\\"8822\\\",\\\"static/chunks/8822-b1e4e7f90c01938f.js\\\",\\\"1816\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/(public)/layout-9bfde039de100cc1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\